# LoonKit v7.0.19 HKBroker · self-maintained immutable Loon remote-rule subscription
# Hong Kong retail brokers: Futu / moomoo, Longbridge / LongPort, Tiger Brokers,
# uSMART Securities, Valuable Capital (VBrokers / 华盛通) and Bright Smart.
# Aggregated from broker-owned sites and community rule sets
# (v2fly/domain-list-community, blackmatrix7 ios_rule_script, forecho/broker-rules,
# HK broker lists), then re-checked against DoH/HTTP on 2026-11-27.
# Parked, expired and shared third-party roots are excluded.
# No keyword rules and no policy in this resource.
# License: GPL-2.0-only; see rules/LICENSE.GPL-2.0 and docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

